# Publish whitelist is controlled by package.json "files".
# This .npmignore only excludes dev/CI noise so that `files` (lib/,
# cordis.yml, README.md, LICENSE) is packed verbatim. Do NOT add `lib`
# here — it is a required build artifact that must ship to npm.
.github
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
npm-debug.log*
test-patch.yml
_dsh_*.png
